# Candidate zip exclusion policy (see #18).
#
# Deny-list via `git archive`'s `export-ignore` attribute: paths here are
# Claude-Code / repo-tooling internals that are meaningless or confusing to a
# candidate. Everything else ships by default — when adding a new internal-only
# path, add it here explicitly rather than assuming it's excluded.

